### Login (JWT for the protected /api/** calls below)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jwt.gate@eh8s.local",
  "password": "eh8s-dev-pass1"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Reconcile without Bearer must be 401
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/reconcile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC"
}

### Reconcile for a non-owner wallet must be 403
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU"
}

### Owner reconcile: scans confirmed money rows vs RPC; demotes orphans; never invents USDC
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC"
}
